Building ucsd-psystem-xc
========================

The cross compiler, assembler, linker and related tools are built by the
top-level Makefile of the UCSD-P-System repository; see README.md there.

Requirements:

    C++17 compiler   The code is compiled as standard C++17.
    libpng           Optional.  Needed only for PNG files in ucsdpsys_foto
                     and ucsdpsys_charset; build with PNG=no to skip it.
    bison 3          Optional.  The generated parsers (grammar.yacc.cc and
                     .h) are checked in; they are regenerated from
                     grammar.y only when bison 3 or later is installed.

libexplain is not needed: a small stand-in is bundled in
subprojects/libexplain.

Peter Miller's original build instructions (Boost, autoconf) are kept, for
history, in etc/BUILDING.man.
